# Flutter/Dart build cache. `.dart_tool/chrome-device/` is a full Chrome PROFILE — it
# contains Cookies, Login Data and Trust Tokens SQLite databases. 153 of those files were
# committed to this repo; the credential tables happened to be empty, but a dev session
# that signs in anywhere would populate them and they would be committed next time.
.dart_tool/
**/.dart_tool/

# Editor settings stay local, but the shared run configuration is committed — it replaced
# the tool-specific .claude/launch.json and is how the web preview is launched.
# (The rule above must be `.vscode/*`, not `.vscode/`: git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so a negation for a file inside one never matches.)
!.vscode/launch.json
